  "synthesis_first": "The full literal Bool flip-energy factor4 is valid for unrestricted signed C2compact f with no convenience premise. Shortest route: per-coordinate pointwise MVT error plus actual36 same-count derivative-observer limit. No external real-product adapter needed.",
